# Objective :
Display all failed logon attempts for all users , likes :
Brute force attacks
Password guessing 
Multiple failed logon attempts against the same user
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1-) Event ID Used : 4625 # Failed Logon Attempt #
2-) KQL Filter : event.code:4625
3-) Fields Used in the Table :
user.name.keyword => Username
host.hostname.keyword => The machine where the logon attempt occurred
winlog.logon.type.keyword => Logon type 
Count of records => Number of failed logon attempts
4-) Filter Improvement :  # To exclude computer accounts and show only Security Logs #
NOT user.name: *$ AND winlog.channel.keyword: Security 



